------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Bundled third-party software in the built Docker image
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The Docker image produced from this repository is a REPACKAGING, not a fork of
the source code. At build time it copies the pre-built `alertmanager` and
`amtool` binaries from the official upstream image `prom/alertmanager`. These
binaries are NOT modified in any way — the dark theme is layered on top at the
HTTP-proxy level (an nginx sub_filter injects a stylesheet), so the Alertmanager
program and its embedded web UI run exactly as shipped upstream.

